        'Under each state’s supply code, load above 10 MVA usually moves to 110 kV, 132 kV or 220 kV supply from a transmission substation.',
        'TNERC’s order T.O. 6 of 2025 set ₹7.50/kWh plus ₹608/kVA a month for Tamil Nadu’s HT-I category, which covers data centres, from 1 July 2025.',
